Package: traderoutes
Title: Compute International Trade Routes
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Mario", "Milone", email = "milonemario@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to query border relationships between countries
    and to compute weighted shortest-path trade routes on a worldwide
    transportation network combining roads, shipping lanes, and ports.
    Border queries use a precomputed adjacency graph; route computation
    supports per-country and per-country-pair cost overrides for roads,
    ports, and land borders.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    igraph
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
